NAME
  vtkSHYXSelectionAppendPatches
  DESCRIPTION
  "Extract selected cells into independent vtkPartitionedDataSetCollection patches (overlaps allowed); rename and stamp a constant mark per patch."
GROUPS
  Meshing
DEPENDS
  VTK::CommonCore
  VTK::CommonDataModel
  VTK::CommonExecutionModel
  VTK::FiltersCore
  VTK::FiltersExtraction
  VTK::FiltersGeometry
